<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/35/msa@/~cl_11> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "11" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/35/msa@> .
